<title>AUSTRIA: Algeria says consensus for six month OPEC rollover.</title>
<headline>Algeria says consensus for six month OPEC rollover.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algerian oil minister Amar Makhloufi said that there was a consensus among OPEC members for a six month output rollover.</p>
<p>&quot;I think there is,&quot; he said when asked by reporters if there was a general support for six month rollover in OPEC.</p>
<p>Asked whether any members favoured a one year rollover, Makhloufi said &quot;why a year, six months is enough.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom +431 713 2034</p>
</text>
